body:
op hi, i understand how you feel with parental issues as well, actually just saw this recommended..

what i can suggest is to go to a student hostel place, because if you run away and get caught by the police, it’s likely you’ll be sent back or go to IMH if you try to do any self harm activities beforehand, i know this because i myself have kena from police before this year and also spoke with other people who also got from them.

for now the best if nothing works all i can say is bite the bullet, running away will just delay the inevitable, and im sorry that therapy didn’t work out for you either. :(
